[{"id":3497939662,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7QflLO","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I can confirm it is illegal to store a reference into a mutating `AHashMap`, for the reasons given in the OP. For more information, see [Core types](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine_details/architecture/core_types.html#containers). \n\nThis is notably not the case for `HashMap`, which was previously used, which I think makes this a regression from #92554 (4.4). Interesting how it didn't come up yet!\n\nConsidering this, an alternative solution to what's proposed here would be exchanging `AHashMap` for `HashMap` again, although this would regress the performance benefits measured in #92554.\nOverall, I'd probably go with the solution proposed here. But I'll leave this decision for the animation team to make.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113039#pullrequestreview-3497939662","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113039","author_association":"ME